OL,3,GNEWSAChief minister says AI brings
OL,4,AJersey opportunities
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtificial intelligence (AI) could help
OL,7,Fto improve public services without
OL,8,Fputting existing jobs at risk and
OL,9,FJersey should seek to benefit from
OL,10,Ftechnological advances, the island's
OL,11,Fchief minister has said.
OL,13,FIn his first major pitch to business
OL,14,Fleaders since his re-election as chief
OL,15,Fminister, Senator Lyndon Farnham said
OL,16,Fministers would support local firms to
OL,17,Fadopt AI, and islanders to develop
OL,18,Fskills needed in modern workplaces.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
