OL,3,GNEWSAChief minister says AI brings
OL,4,AJersey opportunities
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlthough AI had to be used
OL,7,F"responsibly", he added, it could also
OL,8,Fsupport continuing efforts to curb
OL,9,Fgrowth in the public sector.
OL,11,FA recent series of warnings about the
OL,12,Fpotential dangers of AI have led to
OL,13,Fcalls for co-ordinated action to slow
OL,14,Fthe technology's development.
